# Add environment variables here if needed
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Note: The "Latest Reels" section uses Instagram's official embed (embed.js).
# It needs NO access token, API key or login — just paste public reel links
# into the `reels` array in constants/content.ts.

# Weight-loss-webinar registration form -> Google Sheets.
# No Google Cloud project, API key, or service account needed — this is a
# Google Apps Script "Web App" URL bound to your own Sheet (ask Claude for
# the setup steps if you don't have them handy).
# SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXXXXXX/exec
